            "text": "🚨UPDATE – #NORTHHOLLYWOOD: 61-year-old Ihor Demianenko was arrested on suspicion of DUI and is being held on more than $6 million bail following Tuesday evening’s horrific crash that killed three women and injured two others.\n\nDemianenko has been additionally charge with three counts of murder after his Toyota Sienna slammed into pedestrians and street vendors near Lankershim and Chandler boulevards.\n\nThe victims were identified as three women, ages 40, 53 and 69. Two additional women were hospitalized.",
